From 1023ac597340764e4f35acf194176c41c856551d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ubuntu <ubuntu@saturn.cob.bisdn.de>
Date: Mon, 24 Nov 2025 19:12:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] improve backpressure mechanism for subport capacity reduction

Enhance the backpressure mechanism to dynamically reduce available subport 
capacity based on NIC TX buffer drops. This implementation:

- Tracks per-TC drop rates from NIC TX buffer
- Progressively reduces subport capacity quotas during backpressure
- Implements exponential backoff recovery
- Provides configurable drop-rate thresholds
- Adds detailed per-TC statistics tracking

